---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Market Research & Entry — Exporta Global" description="Know exactly which countries demand your product and how to enter them — with a clear, evidence-based go-to-market strategy.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Market Research & Entry</div>
    <span class="pill">Market Research & Entry</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Market Research & Entry</h1>
    <p class="sub">Know exactly which countries demand your product and how to enter them — with a clear, evidence-based go-to-market strategy.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Enter the right market, the right way.</h2>
      <p>Picking a market on a hunch is one of the most expensive mistakes in exporting. Demand, competition, tariffs, and regulations vary enormously between countries.</p><p>We analyze where your product has real demand, what it can sell for, who you'll compete with, and what it takes to enter — then give you a prioritized, actionable entry plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Country-level demand analysis</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Tariff & compliance review</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Competitive positioning</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Landed-cost & pricing model</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Prioritized market ranking</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Actionable entry roadmap</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div><h3>Demand analysis</h3><p>Where your product is wanted, in what volume, and at what price points.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Tariff & regulation review</h3><p>Import duties, standards, and compliance hurdles per target country.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Competitive landscape</h3><p>Who you'll compete with and how to position against them.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div><h3>Pricing strategy</h3><p>Landed-cost modeling so your pricing wins without killing margin.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="3 11 22 2 13 21 11 13 3 11"/></svg></div><h3>Entry roadmap</h3><p>A prioritized, step-by-step plan for your top markets.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Research report</h3><p>A clear written report you and your team can act on immediately.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear, proven process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Scope</h3><p>We define your product, goals, and candidate markets together.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Analyze</h3><p>We assess demand, pricing, competition, and regulations.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Prioritize</h3><p>We rank markets by opportunity and ease of entry.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Plan</h3><p>You get a clear entry roadmap and pricing strategy.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>How many markets do you analyze?</h4><p>A standard engagement compares 3–5 candidate markets; we can expand on request.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Is the research specific to my product?</h4><p>Yes. Everything is built around your exact product category, capacity, and target margins — not generic reports.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Can you help us execute the entry plan?</h4><p>Absolutely — many clients continue with our buyer sourcing and consultancy services to act on the plan.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="market research & entry" selectedService="Market Research & Entry" />
</BaseLayout>
